<figure class="company-brain-map" aria-labelledby="company-brain-map-title">
<div class="brain-map-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Inside the company brain</p><h3 id="company-brain-map-title">One connected body of knowledge.</h3></div>
<div class="brain-map-field">
<svg class="brain-map-connections" viewBox="0 0 600 520" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
<path data-brain-branch="people" d="M155 134C174 150 211 165 240 176"/>
<path data-brain-branch="agents" d="M445 134C426 150 389 165 360 176"/>
<path data-brain-branch="knowledge" d="M248 238C211 282 150 303 90 324"/>
<path data-brain-branch="work" d="M300 314V410"/>
<path data-brain-branch="decisions" d="M352 238C389 282 450 303 510 324"/>
</svg>
<button class="brain-map-node brain-people" data-brain-part="people" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="brain-map-detail" disabled><span class="brain-node-icon"><img src="assets/role-icons/people.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="192" height="192" decoding="async"></span><strong>People</strong><small>Intentions &amp; review</small></button>
<button class="brain-map-node brain-agents" data-brain-part="agents" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="brain-map-detail" disabled><span class="brain-node-icon"><img src="assets/role-icons/agents.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="192" height="192" decoding="async"></span><strong>Agents</strong><small>Scoped sessions</small></button>
<a class="brain-map-core" href="#lab"><img class="brain-core-art" src="assets/role-icons/core.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="192" height="192" decoding="async"><span class="brain-core-caption"><strong>Shared project state</strong><small>Durable knowledge</small></span></a>
<button class="brain-map-node brain-knowledge" data-brain-part="knowledge" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="brain-map-detail" disabled><span class="brain-node-icon"><img src="assets/role-icons/knowledge.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="192" height="192" decoding="async"></span><strong>Knowledge</strong><small>Meaning &amp; evidence</small></button>
<button class="brain-map-node brain-work" data-brain-part="work" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="brain-map-detail" disabled><span class="brain-node-icon"><img src="assets/role-icons/work.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="192" height="192" decoding="async"></span><strong>Work</strong><small>Plans &amp; attempts</small></button>
<button class="brain-map-node brain-decisions" data-brain-part="decisions" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="brain-map-detail" disabled><span class="brain-node-icon"><img src="assets/role-icons/decisions.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="192" height="192" decoding="async"></span><strong>Decisions</strong><small>Review &amp; change</small></button>
</div>
<p class="brain-map-hint">Select a part to explore its role. Select it again to return to the whole.</p>
<div id="brain-map-detail" class="brain-map-detail" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><h3>Knowledge, work and decisions stay connected.</h3><p>People express intentions and review results. Agents act within their permissions. The project keeps the meanings, evidence and decisions that let the work continue.</p></div>
<figcaption>A map of roles around shared project state. <a href="governance-lab-reference.html#system-map">Explore the full system map <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></figcaption>
</figure>
